usage: csk config [-h] {show,build-ssh,build-https} ...

positional arguments:
  {show,build-ssh,build-https}
    show                Print resolved config path and content.
    build-ssh           Manage operator SSH credential scopes for external
                        build repositories.
    build-https         Manage operator HTTPS token scopes for external build
                        repositories.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
